{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simulation where the player tries on the role of an employee in an organization engaged in controlling and filtering information. The action takes place in a fictional office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen dossiers arrive in front of you every day: assess the risks, make a decision - skip, ban or \u201cliquidate\u201d. Each decision affects the satirical news feed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This version of the game contains a limited number of in-game days and content. The full version will feature more content and days, as well as new characters and new entries about them. Plus, there will be additional fun surprises.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067840/extras/\u0413\u0438\u04443?t=1759249490\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fend off any particularly obnoxious guests.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main task of the player is to process the flow of incoming information, analyze it for compliance with the established rules and make decisions about its further fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067840/extras/\u0413\u0438\u04442?t=1759249490\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Your decisions affect the news.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of people walk into your virtual office every day, from regular citizens to potentially dangerous people who could do harm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067840/extras/\u0413\u0438\u04445?t=1759249490\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes different events can happen.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must scrutinize every detail, look for hidden clues, and match a person's data to an ever-changing set of rules and regulations. One wrong decision could cost you your career, and maybe more....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document check: examine photos, dossier and text, look for forbidden markers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible actions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Skip - the information goes on without interference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Ban - the person can no longer share data, but remains alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Eliminate - extreme measure: the character disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >News every working day: satirical headlines reflecting the public mood appear at the end of the shift (7 days in total).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and Easter hints: sarcastic memes, posters, different events every working day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067840/extras/\u0413\u0438\u04446?t=1759249490\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And good job!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067840?t=1759249490","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067840?t=1759249490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067840/844b559e68dd5054d447843f0ac8bddddccd5190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759249490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067840/844b559e68dd5054d447843f0ac8bddddccd5190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759249490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":